    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 29 April 2026, the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted on 29 April 2026 and numbered A2063-001, A2063-002, A2063-003, A2063-004, A2063-006 was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990.\r\n \r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class B, Clauses B.1 (d)(ii) of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the cubic content of the resulting roof space would exceed the cubic content of the original roof by more than 50 cubic metres.\r\n"
